{"id":"jit81maijgxbfidex1nzmqj3q","title":"思想之书·1·4、社会之逻辑","originalTitle":null,"summary":"社会由法律、伦理道德等构成的逻辑网络结构组成，这些逻辑影响个体行为并形成集体逻辑。社会本身不具有逻辑形式，而是由具有意识逻辑能力的个体共同构建。社会矛盾源于不同逻辑构成的集体之间的矛盾，无法完全通过法律和伦理解决。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1767125&do=blog&id=1561538"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T03:01:25.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T08:08:23.119Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T08:08:23.119Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":12,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"fbd1a5c1-30f7-46e6-8506-8208ef677ab5","title":"科学网博客提出社会由逻辑网络构成且矛盾无法完全解决"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"fbd1a5c1-30f7-46e6-8506-8208ef677ab5","title":"科学网博客提出社会由逻辑网络构成且矛盾无法完全解决"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f--UKmUT48ko","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}